  storyText: "Bad Trade\n\nA Claw grabs the shard and slots it straight into his neck. His eyes flood with static. He screams, draws his pistol and starts shooting at everything that moves.\n\nThe shard pops out and rolls to your feet.\n\n1. Grab the shard and run.\n2. Hide behind the bar and wait."
